goodbye.

00:08:19.632 --> 00:08:20.466
And Erick, look,

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:22.001
we know DeSantis is a favorite

00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:23.202
among GOP donors.

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:24.504
That has been true for a while.

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:26.005
They've been looking for an alternative

00:08:26.005 --> 00:08:26.672
to Trump.

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:27.306
Trump's base,

00:08:27.306 --> 00:08:29.509
though, voters have been loyal to Trump.

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:32.211
Is DeSantis peeling off some of them?

00:08:32.245 --> 00:08:33.813
Is this working?

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.281
Yeah, look, I think so.

00:08:35.281 --> 00:08:36.883
And I realize you see some polls

00:08:36.883 --> 00:08:38.751
that have Trump versus DeSantis

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:39.752
and Trump is winning.

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:40.920
But it's

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.922
a drought declared for 20, 24

00:08:43.155 --> 00:08:44.524
versus a hypothetical.

00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:46.592
Ron DeSantis, who hasn't announced yet.

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:47.927
I think you do begin to see

00:08:47.927 --> 00:08:48.895
a shift over time.

00:08:48.895 --> 00:08:51.397
And these culture issues for Trump voters

00:08:51.397 --> 00:08:53.366
right now kind of dominate.

00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:54.901
And DeSantis behind

00:08:54.901 --> 00:08:56.969
the scenes is already saying to people

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:58.237
look at these things

00:08:58.237 --> 00:08:58.971
I got done,

00:08:58.971 --> 00:09:00.473
including against Tony Fauci

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:02.174
who Donald Trump elevated,

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:04.110
causing people to shift

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.244
to McCarty's point.

00:09:05.244 --> 00:09:06.212
There is a concern.

00:09:06.212 --> 00:09:07.713
Can Republicans

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.916
flip back to talk about economic issues?

00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:10.349
I think

00:09:10.349 --> 00:09:11.717
because Florida is such

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.352
an economic engine for the nation,

00:09:13.352 --> 00:09:15.087
he'll have that opportunity.

00:09:15.087 --> 00:09:16.556
All right. Thank you both very much.

